{"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.01458757870048466,"y":0.096848410193274836,"w":0.076800861358642614,"c":1,"t":"Reading","x":0.79183620829314005},{"y":0.14098837194685609,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"t":"In turn, big businesses can exert powerful pressure on any suppliers that might ignore public","x":0.086419750794424599,"w":0.7366255187988282},{"y":0.15694935201908533,"h":0.016015764400450716,"w":0.74279836018880208,"c":1,"x":0.088477363058044128,"t":"or government pressure. For instance, after the US public became concerned about the spread"},{"y":0.17267839390729645,"t":"of a disease known as BSE, which was transmitted to humans through infected meat, the US","h":0.019720875051473685,"x":0.086363901778841137,"c":1,"w":0.7367593892415365},{"y":0.19024274818593834,"h":0.018163568701143107,"t":"government's Food and Drug Administration introduced rules demanding that the meat industry","x":0.088407976165025465,"w":0.76145050048828122,"c":1},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"abandon practices associated with the risk of the disease spreading. But for five years the meat","y":0.20784883706311952,"c":1,"w":0.75514404296875004,"x":0.086419747957489315},{"w":0.74290720621744799,"c":1,"y":0.22364793885049095,"t":"packers refused to follow these, claiming that they would be too expensive to obey. However,","x":0.086355564736836643,"h":0.018270826171227994},{"y":0.24016220013447109,"x":0.088396579289119467,"h":0.018007314949350151,"c":1,"t":"when a major fast-food company then made the same demands after customer purchases of its","w":0.75118891398111975},{"c":1,"h":0.018072953353360677,"w":0.7675913492838542,"t":"hamburgers plummeted, the meat industry complied within weeks. The public's task is therefore","x":0.086375737060155111,"y":0.25706744877983223},{"x":0.086419759341744493,"w":0.77572016398111976,"h":0.01744185965530165,"y":0.27325581414037248,"t":"to identify which links in the supply chain are sensitive to public pressure: for instance, fast-food","c":1},{"t":"chains or jewelry stores, but not meat packers or gold miners.","x":0.088399600935798101,"h":0.019721666971842411,"w":0.49397628784179681,"y":0.29053251418806736,"c":1},{"t":"Some readers may be disappointed or outraged that I place the ultimate responsibility for business","x":0.08847736551609918,"y":0.32412790683078341,"w":0.78189300537109374,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1},{"h":0.018605672007314666,"y":0.33972479288351964,"x":0.088394363899198164,"w":0.74500885009765627,"t":"practices harming the public on the public itself. I also believe that the public must accept the","c":1},{"t":"necessity for higher prices for products to cover the added costs, if any, of sound environmental","c":1,"y":0.35673549194583387,"x":0.088401467662847039,"w":0.76147842407226562,"h":0.019100832854901162},{"h":0.016048292108362783,"t":"practices. My views may seem to ignore the belief that businesses should act in accordance with","x":0.08847735926378808,"y":0.37499999985376098,"w":0.76748972574869789,"c":1},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.77160491943359366,"t":"moral principles even if this leads to a reduction in their profits. But I think we have to recognize","y":0.39098837194279379,"c":1,"x":0.088477375674992892},{"x":0.08847735760674634,"w":0.77983540852864586,"c":1,"h":0.017469252798666846,"y":0.40694935200100701,"t":"that, throughout human history, in all politically complex human societies, government regulation"},{"y":0.42186550398501854,"h":0.021436707010258016,"w":0.73685145060221358,"t":"has arisen precisely because it was found that not only did moral principles need to be made","c":1,"x":0.086324538459966224},{"c":1,"w":0.32716049194335939,"x":0.088477367087361924,"h":0.017503492402524801,"t":"explicit, they also needed to be enforced.","y":0.44186046495233344},{"h":0.01892785161066679,"c":1,"t":"To me, the conclusion that the public has the ultimate responsibility for the behavior of even the","x":0.08842465291367177,"y":0.47356705757849982,"w":0.76554173787434909},{"t":"biggest businesses is empowering and hopeful, rather than disappointing. My conclusion is not a","h":0.017667844522968212,"x":0.088477378493079656,"c":1,"w":0.77160491943359366,"y":0.48969375721330632},{"y":0.50692311869346096,"h":0.01895026127216537,"w":0.76765065511067698,"c":1,"t":"moralistic one about who is right or wrong, admirable or selfish, a good guy or a bad guy. In the","x":0.088394790723702668},{"w":0.76349487304687502,"t":"past, businesses have changed when the public came to expect and require different behavior, to","x":0.088411088460956272,"c":1,"y":0.5231450289037386,"h":0.019091369125671775},{"y":0.54028547515523728,"w":0.77584070841471364,"h":0.0186943698968427,"c":1,"x":0.086360561852092801,"t":"reward businesses for behavior that the public wanted, and to make things difficult for businesses"},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"y":0.55800942278216559,"x":0.088477371189349577,"w":0.74485595703124996,"t":"practicing behaviors that the public didn't want. I predict that in the future, just as in the past,"},{"h":0.022376054869383322,"w":0.75949330647786462,"y":0.57153692021952707,"c":1,"x":0.08835101245939124,"t":"changes in public attitudes will be essential for changes in businesses' environmental practices."},{"x":0.84773662560821061,"w":0.024691357612609766,"t":"89","y":0.91569767424158999,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1}],"h":3395}